    "robustness": "Anchored on its label cell. The card grid's header row carries the CARD STATUS label and no control, so status is a rendered label here and never an anchor key."
   },
   {
    "id": "CARD_APPLY",
    "screen": "CARD_SERVICES",
    "framePath": [
     {
      "name": "content",
